        victory: _("Destroy the signal beacon Don’t be seen by a goblin or saurian during their turn Then, defeat all enemies Defeat enemies before any escape"),
        defeat: _("A goblin or saurian sees you during their turn Death of Delfador Turns run out Any enemy reaches the west edge of the map Death of Delfador Turns run out"),
